<title>UK: British Building gets possible bid approach.</title>
<headline>British Building gets possible bid approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Building and Engineering Appliances Plc said on Thursday that it has received an approach which might lead to an offer for the company.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>By 1105 GMT, shares in the company had risen 11p to stand at 66-1/2.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
